---
permalink: /robots.txt
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
# WhereTo Trips crawler policy
#
# AI assistants and search engines are welcome: that is how travelers find us.
# The named AI crawlers are listed so the choice is explicit, and they share
# ONE group with "*". A crawler obeys only the most specific group naming it,
# so a separate "User-agent: GPTBot / Allow: /" group would silently exempt it
# from every Disallow below.
#
# The Disallow list lives in src/_data/crawl.json and is shared with
# sitemap.xml, so the two can never disagree.
{% for bot in crawl.aiBots %}
User-agent: {{ bot }}
{%- endfor %}
User-agent: *
Allow: /
{%- for p in crawl.disallow %}
Disallow: {{ p }}
{%- endfor %}

Sitemap: {{ site.url }}/sitemap.xml
